{"availability":"available","full":"cbratkovics/chatbot-ai-system","name":"chatbot-ai-system","description":"Multi-provider LLM chat service — FastAPI + Next.js. Automatic failover (OpenAI → Groq), SSE streaming, response caching with optional Redis, per-request telemetry (provider, cache hit, latency, tokens, cost), demo guardrails. Runs free-tier on Render + Vercel. ADRs and honest benchmarks included.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":5,"forks":1,"created":"2025-08-28T22:24:10Z","updated":"2026-09-09T11:49:08Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://chatbot-ai-system.vercel.app","topics":["caching","docker","fastapi","groq","llm","llm-orchestration","llmops","mlops","nextjs","openai","python","redis","render","server-sent-events","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://chatbot-ai-system.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:39.431Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:39.431Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:39.431Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:41:46.189Z","stars":5,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-08T06:38:31.368Z","stars":5,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:39.431Z","stars":5,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A FastAPI + Next.js LLM gateway that shows its own engineering on screen. Every answer carries a telemetry chip: the provider and model that answered, cache HIT or MISS with the similarity score, latency, tokens, cost paid and cost avoided, and the failover chain for that request. An Evidence rail aggregates the session, a guided demo runs the three headline behaviours with real requests, and /evals publishes precision and recall for the cache from a committed benchmark run."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cbratkovics/chatbot-ai-system/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"77ee7e041690c4efd0d94202e1b1fd537acf3cf28cfd8b015152b8b6a5f8faa0","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:46.272Z"},"overviewCheckedAt